*.tar
*.tgz
*.zip
*.partial

# Default-deny closure: only the four Dockerfile COPY sources stay in context.
# Negations re-include exactly requirements.txt, requirements.lock, wheels/, app/.
# Dockerfile and .dockerignore are implicitly available to Docker and need no negation.
*
!requirements.txt
!requirements.lock
!wheels/
!wheels/**
!app/
!app/**
